  nonce: f27d  # f27d
  message: "2026-10-27: closure test, PR #1905: packages/hypergumbo-core/tests/test_medium_families.py (cross-catalogue medium families), rows c:stdio.printf and c:stdio.putchar are strict xfails naming this item. It also answers this item's 'Not checked': across the 12 stdout members in 9 catalogues, these two are the only stdout-only writers not rowed logging; elixir IO.inspect is a different shape (fs_read, WI-jofud). Mutation check: moving printf/putchar to logging XPASSes both."  # f27d
- op: discuss  # 5085
