  clock: 3  # 5085
  nonce: '5085'  # 5085
  message: "REPRO THROUGH verify-claims, 2026-11-17 (release 10.0.0 and dev a44572db3, same result). Fixture ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/post_release_11162026/side_defects/c_printf/main.c: `char *k = getenv(\"API_KEY\"); printf(\"%s\\n\", k);`; claim host_secret must not reach host_fs (side_defects/claims_fs.yaml). `hypergumbo verify-claims c_printf --claims claims_fs.yaml --format json` -> violated, exit 1, one evidence row host_secret -> host_fs with sink printf, walk verdict reached. The same program in Go (fmt.Println) or Python (print) leaves that claim clean. Found during the WI-buzup alias study, whose C fixtures had to avoid printf as the non-sink use. A duplicate item I filed for this (WI-guzuv-movog-vupul-ditiv-zanuh-sobup-nilug-vidaf) is closed."  # 5085
